   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The maximum number of symbols in a row is three.</p>\n<p>Special combinations: IV = 4, IX = 9, XL = 40, XC = 90, CD = 400, CM = 900</p>\n<p>Write the larger symbols first.</p>\n<p>Write 49 as a sum where there is an equivalent Roman numeral or special combination.</p>\n<p>49 = 10 + 10 + 10 + 10 + 5 + 1 + 1 + 1 + 1</p>\n<p>This would have more than three symbols in a row. Look at the special combinations. You can use the ones for 40 and 9.</p>\n<p>49 = 40 + 9</p>\n<p>Translate to Roman numerals: XLIX</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "XLIX"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
