     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The maximum number of symbols in a row is three.</p>\n<p>Special combinations: IV = 4, IX = 9, XL = 40, XC = 90, CD = 400, CM = 900</p>\n<p>Write the larger symbols first.</p>\n<p>Write 739 as a sum where there is an equivalent Roman numeral or special combination.</p>\n<p>739 = 500 + 100 + 100 + 10 + 10 + 10 + 9</p>\n<p>Translate to Roman numerals: DCCXXXIX</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
