     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The maximum number of symbols in a row is three.</p>\n<p>Special combinations: IV = 4, IX = 9, XL = 40, XC = 90, CD = 400, CM = 900</p>\n<p>Write the larger symbols first.</p>\n<p>Write 3,647 as a sum where there is an equivalent Roman numeral or special combination.</p>\n<p>3,647 = 1,000 + 1,000 + 1,000 + 500 + 100 + 40 + 5 + 1 + 1</p>\n<p>Translate to Roman numerals: MMMDCXLVII</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "MMMDCXLVII"
    }
   ],
